### Lab 2: SQLite Database and CRUD Routes - HTTP Requests File
### You can run these directly in VS Code (with REST Client / Thunder Client) or Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. API Health & Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET /books/ - Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/

### 3. GET /books/:bookId/ - Get single book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/

### 4. POST /books/ - Add a new book
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Node.js Design Patterns",
  "author": "Mario Casciaro & Luciano Mammino",
  "price": 799,
  "pages": 660
}

### 5. PUT /books/:bookId/ - Update an existing book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/11/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Node.js Design Patterns (3rd Edition)",
  "author": "Mario Casciaro & Luciano Mammino",
  "price": 850,
  "pages": 680
}

### 6. DELETE /books/:bookId/ - Delete a book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/11/

### 7. GET /books/999/ - 404 Error Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
